# No em dashes

Never use an em dash (—) in copy for this website, including page text, meta descriptions, form labels, and hidden product copy that can be turned back on.

Use a period, a comma, a colon, or parentheses instead. Do not swap in an en dash as a pause.

Number ranges can use a hyphen, as in 1-2 hours.
